      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tip about the angle, i'll check that. but the splintering is so inconsistent. sometimes it's perfect, then suddenly a piece just pops out for no reason, even when i'm following all your advice. it's almost like the wood has a mind of its own or there's something hidden in the grain that's causing it. have you ever seen anything like that? like some kind of defect that's hard to spot?",
      "source": "evaluator"
